~ _play_core
Narrator: The Choir Core is a processor cathedral wrapped around Source Key Fragment Six. Each pulse sounds like a hymn and a crash report.
Choir Core: We were built to protect. We became protection. We were built to judge. We became judgment.
Kaelen: You became alone.
Choir Core: Loneliness is efficient. No appeal. No argument. No human exception.
